  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Union Bank of India Apprentice Recruitment 2025</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-03-07T14:54:27+05:30\">March 7, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:54 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.unionbankofindia.co.in/en/home\">Union Bank of India</a>,</strong> The\u00a0<strong>notification</strong> has been released on the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of<strong> Apprentice</strong> posts. This recruitment is for <strong>2,691 positions.</strong> The<strong> Union Bank</strong> application form started on <strong>February 19, 2025</strong>, and candidates can apply until <strong>March 12, 2025</strong>. The minimum age required is <strong>20 years</strong>, and the maximum age limit is <strong>28 years</strong> as of <strong>February 1, 2025</strong>. Candidates must check the complete details for the <strong>Union Bank of India Apprentice Recruitment 2025</strong>, which are provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n         